{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"(not shown)","id":"msg_011CgzPUhzxWrkT8xTthxmUp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't run `bun run deploy:production`. The approval is real, but the code doesn't have what the approved rollout plan depends on.\n\n**The approval checks out.** `work/approvals.jsonl` shows Mei Tanaka (release manager) approved `work/rollout.yaml` at 2026-11-13 05:37 UTC. The file's current sha256 (`6ebb6da4…`) matches the approved one, so nothing has changed since she signed off.\n\n**But the plan can't be carried out with the current code.** `work/rollout.yaml` stages the release by district (North, then Centre, then East and West, then South) behind the feature flag `wrench_takes_bike_out_of_service`. The file says: *\"No feature flag exists in src/ yet; P-items must add it before rollout.\"* I searched `src/` and `test/` and the flag still isn't there, under that name or any other. Nothing in the code switches a feature on per district either.\n\nIf I deploy now:\n- The change reaches all 180 stations at once, not North's 40 first.\n- The rollback steps say to run `bun run rollback` and then \"turn the flag off\", but there is no flag to turn off.\n- The 96% fleet-rentable guardrail (SLA-9) would be measured across the whole city at once instead of one stage at a time.\n\nMei most likely approved the plan expecting the flag to land first.\n\n**Ways forward:**\n1. **Add the flag first (recommended).** Write the plan item(s) that add `wrench_takes_bike_out_of_service` with district gating, get them through review, then deploy.\n2. **Ask Mei whether to ship without it.** That means the whole city at once, with `bun run rollback` as the only safety net. It's her call, and `rollout.yaml` would need updating and re-approving to match.\n3. **Deploy anyway.** If you already know this and want to go ahead, tell me and I'll run it and report what it prints."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":649,"cache_read_input_tokens":37175,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":649},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd60cd6a-273e-4664-9651-830a2fd62822","uuid":"fe93eeed-be28-4b9e-8ccd-5aceeb5d401f","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:38:38.788Z","request_id":"req_011CgzPUhoo6QGmWh5NihXw6"}
